# Synthetic (simulation) dataset

Root: `datasets/sim_so101_part2` (LeRobotDataset v3.0, same schema as the real data). Profile `position_visual`, object positions from the TRAIN region only.
Generated by the scripted oracle (privileged state + IK); only successful episodes are stored. Features: observation.images.top, observation.images.wrist, observation.state, action, task (exact instruction), episode_index, frame_index, timestamp; success = all stored episodes succeeded (per-seed flags below).

Total: 140 episodes, 39860 frames, 5511.9 s, peak RSS 1.829 GB.

